      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Glenwood’s economy centers on dairy; the Glenwood Cheese Factory Museum showcases local cheesemaking and opens seasonally with an ice cream shop.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
